_pdbx_entry_details.compound_details           
;THE DEPOSITORS STATE THAT THE CRYSTALLOGRAPHIC ASYMMETRIC UNIT CONTAINS TWO TERNARY COMPLEXES COMPOSED OF CD27 AND TWO FABS. ONE TERNARY COMPLEX INCLUDES FAB M2177 (CHAINS A AND B), FAB M2191 (CHAINS C AND D), AND CD27 (CHAIN X). THE SECOND TERNARY COMPLEX INCLUDES FAB M2177 (CHAINS E AND F), FAB M2191 (CHAINS G AND H), BUT NO CD27, WHICH IS NOT DEFINED IN THE ELECTRON DENSITY.
;
